  "description": "Lexical (BM25), semantic and hybrid file search for .NET: point it at some folders, build an index and search, without knowing how it works inside.",
  "id": "Ferret",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-01T10:20:21.157Z",
